{
    "pageid": 25,
    "title": "The Prince and the Thane",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "This mod is quite a few things rolled into one and differs from other overhaul-type mods in that gameplay tweaks are largely overshadowed by new event chains and his complete redesign of the buildings system."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Features",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "A whole range of new traits gainable both through education and dedicated events.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New guelph vs. ghibellines system, with related traits, historical characters and events.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "A new and more accurate set of both historical and randomly generated coats of arms.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "More than 100 famous historical characters fully implemented with a chance to welcome them to your court.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many new holy orders and mercenary bands.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New templar system.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Lots of new flavour and everyday life events.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Extended grand hunt and new ball decision.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Jewish communities and religion fully implemented, with two separate cultures (ashkenazi and sephardic).",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many new cultures and 'melting pot' events.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Lots of new decisions to implement historical reforms in selected kingdoms and empires.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many new plots and ambitions.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "More religious depth with many dedicated events.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many more intrigue and romance opportunities and dedicated event chains.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many new everyday and historical decisions.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Completely new building system.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many new bookmarks.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Extended map with more provinces.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New education system.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many new kingdoms and empires.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "More economic flavour with the addition of the maritime republics and the hanseatic league.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Deadlier wars and sieges with dedicated events and decisions.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Better looking characters and cities.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New cardinal and papal election system.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many culturally differentiated laws.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New dowry on marriage system.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New fealty and civil war system.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New holy orders with the chance to found them!",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many relic dedicated events with hunts for the grail and the shroud.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "General effort to achieve balance, realism and immersion.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
