            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Bugfix.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Version 1.5",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "General mod features' bugfix and polishing.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Completely reworked portraits.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New raiding system for norses.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added in a few historical Italian dynasties to their holdings.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Major focus on republics with many new flags, the additions of the republics of ragusa, amalfi, San Marino and ancona and some historical events to give pisa, genoa and venice a chance to get some of their historical colonies.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Reworked trait and decision icons.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Removed some bits and pieces of useless features and events.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Nerfed the battle death rates.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New rebel event where there is a chance that the populace nominates a local noble as the county ruler thus revolting against your rule with an independence cb.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "All the remaining mod features should work as intended as of now.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}